Web Image: a support method for the UNSTRUCTURED_LOCKING bytecode exception.

Web Image maps each kind of bytecode exception to a method of its
ImplicitExceptions that creates it, and has none for UNSTRUCTURED_LOCKING,
which SubstrateVM's graph builder emits wherever a method's monitors are not
structured (JVMS 2.11.10). The build then aborts in
WebImageImplicitExceptionsFeature.getSupportMethodName on the first such
method; kotlinc has several. This adds the method, creating the
IllegalMonitorStateException SubstrateVM's own lowering creates, and maps
the kind to it. The path only runs when monitors are misused.

